  "prefLabel": "Env-A 608.10 Permit Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 608.10 Permit Renewal.\n\n(a) The owner or operator shall file with the department an application for permit renewal at least 90 days prior to the designated expiration date of the existing state permit to operate.\n\n(b) The owner or operator shall pay to the department any applicable fee as established in Env-A 700 with the application for permit renewal.\n\nSource. #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9791, eff 10-1-10; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
